  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "I am Sam. Today I am at the zoo. I see many animals. I see a gray donkey. It is small. I see a white duck. It is on the water. I see two brown horses.",
      "I have a bag of food. I have a carrot. It is orange. I have chips. I have candy. The donkey looks at me. Dad says, \"Give the carrot to the donkey.\" I hold the carrot. The donkey eats it. \"Is candy good for animals?\" I ask. \"No,\" says Dad. \"Chips and candy are for you.\"",
      "I eat my chips. A chicken looks at me. I see three sheep. They are white. The ducks swim. The donkey is my favorite. I say, \"Bye, donkey!\" It is a happy day."
    ],
    "summary": "Sam goes to the zoo with Dad. He tells us the animals, the colors, and the food that he and the animals eat.",
